arXiv 摘要与 v1 历史，正文第 3 节个体构成、选择及第 3.2 节 mutation 机制；未复现实验。"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-sections","children":[["$","section","problem",{"id":"problem","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",1]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Research Problem",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"手写 prompt 容易受具体任务和设计者经验限制，固定的 prompt 改写 strategy 也可能阻碍 search。论文研究能否让 language model 进化任务 prompt，同时调整产生 prompt 变体的规则，使下一轮 search 采用由系统自己更新的改进 strategy。"}]]}]]}],["$","section","insight",{"id":"insight","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",2]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Insight","$L10"]}],"$L11"]}]]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}],"$L1b"]}]]}]
10:["$","small",null,{"children":"本站解读"}]
11:["$","p",null,{"children":"如果 mutation 规则也用自然语言表示，generator 就可以把自己的操作条件作为可编辑对象。由此可区分直接改进任务 prompt 和改进产生 prompt 的方法：后者会影响下一轮候选的分布，是本文自指机制的核心。"}]
12:["$","section","observation",{"id":"observation","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",3]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Observation",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"一个进化个体同时保留任务 prompt、mutation prompt 以及可选的成功 reasoning 示例，任务 fitness 决定选择。论文展示 mutation prompt 能够被 hypermutation 操作更新；但决定使用哪些操作以及如何评估个体的外层框架仍由研究者预设。"}]]}]]}]
13:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",4]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Method",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"初始化多样化 prompt population，在训练题目上评估任务表现，以 tournament selection 保留更好的个体。language model 执行直接改写、分布式 mutation 等操作；hypermutation 会重写 mutation prompt，更新后的 mutation prompt 再参与后续任务 prompt 生成。"}]]}]]}]
14:["$","section","results",{"id":"results","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",5]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Results",false]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者报告，进化出的 prompt 在算术与常识 reasoning benchmark 上超过所比较的人工 prompt strategy，并能产生适用于仇恨言论分类的复杂 prompt。实验验证了有限任务域中的 prompt evolution，不意味着 language model 底层参数或通用能力持续增加。"}]]}]]}]
15:["$","section","limits",{"id":"limits","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",6]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Limitations",["$","small",null,{"children":"本站解读"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"fitness 来自带答案的训练任务，base language model、外层选择算法和 hypermutation 机制仍固定。可编辑对象主要是 prompt 文本，结果受任务分布与评估预算制约；这里的 self-modification 范围不能延伸为完整系统任意重写和无界进步。"}]]}]]}]
16:["$","section","outlook",{"id":"outlook","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":["0",7]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["Outlook",["$","small",null,{"children":"本站解读"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"编辑展望：应在相同候选生成和评估预算下比较固定 mutation 与可 mutation 改进 strategy，并检验学到的 mutation prompt 能否迁移到新任务。这样才能分离 improver 更新的实际贡献与单纯扩大 prompt search 数量带来的收益。"}]]}]]}]
17:["$","aside",null,{"className":"rsi-relation","id":"rsi-relation","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"overline","children":"EDITORIAL NOTE · 本站判断"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Relation to RSI"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"mutation prompt 承担后续候选生成的改进职责，并能由系统重写后投入下一轮，因此归为受限的 Improver Self-Modification。主分类落在 Agents & Code 方向的 prompt strategy 层，明确其不修改 model weights 或全部进化程序。"}]]}]
